                                                "sense_id": "fac033ee-8abe-3f66-9e6e-a5b2776638d4",
                                                "text": "She […] liv'd in a Cottage, far retir'd / Among the Windings of a woody Vale […]."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3ee2b41d-575e-3728-b7fc-baf9684c2645",
