                                                "sense_id": "a07fc2bb-2d09-3272-8031-22ca8a20d4a5",
                                                "text": "with the wooddie Nymphes when she did play, / Or when the flying Libbard she did chace, / She could them nimbly moue, and after fly apace."
                                            }
